uote"> <p><strong>&lt;Begin Log, ██:██&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> Okay, This is Dr. ██████ with interview-5133-A of SCP-5133</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> Please, Call me █████.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> I am afraid I have to call you SCP-5133.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> Okay then.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> When did your abilities first manifest?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> When I was ██ I think. it was about ███ years ago so my memory has gone a bit fuzzy.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> Ok, Where did you find SCP-5133-3?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> Where did I find what?</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> Your sword.</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> Oh that old thing. I found it about ███ years ago, while travelling through a portal and it was just there. It had not been there before but then it was there, out of nowhere.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> Thank you. How do you create the portals?</p> <p><strong>SCP-5133:</strong> I am not fully sure myself, I usually think of where i want to go and one appears but sometimes one appears without me thinking about it.</p> <p><strong>Dr. ██████:</strong> Thank you. I think we are done here.</p> <p><strong>&lt;End Log, ██:██&gt;</strong></p> <p><strong>Closing Statement:</strong> Dr. ██████ left the room and SCP-5133 was successfully returned to containment.</p> </div> <div class="footer-wikiwalk-nav"> <div style="text-align: center;"> <p>&#171; <a href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5132">SCP-5132</a> | SCP-5133 | <a class="newpage" href="http://www.scpwiki.com/scp-5134">SCP-5134</a> &#187;</p> </div> </div> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/lestabbyhuman" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6994888&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606919486" alt="LeStabbyHuman" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6994888)" /></a><a href="http://www.wi